   200→    <h1>API Documentation</h1>
   201→    <p class="subtitle">RESTful JSON endpoints for accessing radiation measurement data</p>
   202→
   203→    <h2>Overview</h2>
   204→    <p>The Safecast New Map API provides programmatic access to radiation measurements, track data, and statistics. All endpoints return JSON and are accessible from <code>__API_ROOT__</code> on <code>__DISPLAY_HOST__</code>.</p>
   205→    <p><strong>Base URL:</strong> <code>__BASE_URL__</code></p>
   206→
   207→    <h2>Quick Reference</h2>
   208→
   209→    <div class="endpoint">
   210→      <div class="endpoint-header">
   211→        <span class="method">GET</span>
   212→        <span class="path">/api</span>
   213→      </div>
   214→      <p>Machine-readable index listing all available endpoints, dataset statistics, and server metadata.</p>
   215→      <div class="example">
   216→        <div class="example-label">Try it:</div>
   217→        <a href="__BASE_URL__/api" target="_blank" rel="noopener">__BASE_URL__/api</a>
   218→      </div>
   219→    </div>
   220→
   221→    <div class="endpoint">
   222→      <div class="endpoint-header">
   223→        <span class="method">GET</span>
   224→        <span class="path">/api/latest</span>
   225→      </div>
   226→      <p>Retrieve the latest radiation measurements within a geographic radius.</p>
   227→      <p><strong>Parameters:</strong></p>
   228→      <ul>
   229→        <li><code>lat</code> - Latitude in decimal degrees</li>
   230→        <li><code>lon</code> - Longitude in decimal degrees</li>
   231→        <li><code>radius_m</code> - Search radius in meters</li>
   232→        <li><code>limit</code> - Maximum results (default: 25, max: 200)</li>
   233→      </ul>
   234→      <div class="example">
   235→        <div class="example-label">Examples:</div>
   236→        <a href="__BASE_URL__/api/latest?lat=35.6804&lon=139.7690&radius_m=1500&limit=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Latest near Tokyo</a><br>
   237→        <a href="__BASE_URL__/api/latest?lat=51.3890&lon=30.0990&radius_m=2200&limit=20" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Latest near Chernobyl</a>
   238→      </div>
   239→      <pre><code>curl -s "__BASE_URL__/api/latest?lat=35.6804&lon=139.7690&radius_m=1500&limit=10" | jq</code></pre>
